#: tools/templates/download.html:65
msgid "These archives contain all the content in the documentation."
msgstr "Ces archives contiennent toute la documentation."

#: tools/templates/download.html:67
msgid ""
"\n"
"We no longer provide pre-built PDFs of the documentation.\n"
"To build a PDF archive, follow the instructions in the\n"
"<a href=\"https://devguide.python.org/documentation/start-documenting/"
"#building-the-documentation\">Developer's Guide</a>\n"
"and run <code>make dist-pdf</code> in the <code>Doc/</code> directory of a "
"copy of the CPython repository.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Nous ne fournissons plus la documentation au format PDF.\n"
"Pour la générer au format PDF vous pouvez suivre les instructions du\n"
"<a href=\"https://devguide.python.org/documentation/start-documenting/"
"#building-the-documentation\">Guide du développeur</a>\n"
"et exécuter ``make dist-pdf`` dans le dossier ``Doc/`` d'un clone du dépôt "
"de CPython.\n"

#: tools/templates/download.html:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"See the <a href=\"https://docs.python.org/%(version)s/archives/\">directory "
"listing</a>\n"
"for file sizes."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"La taille de chaque fichier est visible sur la <a href=\"https://"
"docs.python.org/%(version)s/archives/\">liste des fichiers</a>."

#: tools/templates/download.html:79
msgid "Problems"
msgstr "Problèmes"

